      "text": "F8 • UNPROVEN\nRECOVERY SET\nLOGICAL DB includes all\ndurable rows (passkey\ncredential data, hashed\nrecovery-code state,\ntoken rows per ADR 0003).\nRaw recovery codes not\nstored in DB.\nFile-backed secrets +\nprivate keys:\noutside DB and dump.\nSeparate protected\nkey/config inventory.",
